    fade-in, per-state cross-fades, a brief "Bestätigt" checkmark beat
    before login, dimmed/labeled expired-code state, subtle waiting
    pulse, explicit hover/pressed/focus/disabled styling on the
    custom-styled alternate-code button). Purely visual; no change to
    the flow/security state machine, PAM, broker, or KWallet logic.

